WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.473
This is Ledgerton. He keeps your books.

2
00:00:04.023 --> 00:00:11.920
Documents reach him three ways. A folder he watches. An address you forward to. Or handed straight over, from the menu bar.

3
00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:20.109
He reads each one with Claude, or ChatGPT. Whichever you already pay for, on a subscription or an API key.

4
00:00:20.659 --> 00:00:24.770
Supplier, document number, dates, every VAT line.

5
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.642
Then he checks the arithmetic himself.

6
00:00:28.192 --> 00:00:32.967
A copy is filed under the month the document was issued. Never the day you scanned it.

7
00:00:33.517 --> 00:00:40.962
And it is booked into SuperFaktura, with the original attached. Or into mPOHODA, or KROS, if those are the books you keep.

8
00:00:41.512 --> 00:00:44.673
Every document announced in Slack, with its numbers.

9
00:00:45.223 --> 00:00:49.290
Anything he cannot vouch for waits for you, with the reason written out.

10
00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:54.650
Approve it in Slack, or from the menu bar. Nothing is booked until you say so.

11
00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.593
Ledgerton. Butler and bookkeeper, at your service.
